COMMENT     Draft genome of Candida jaroonii CLIB 1444, sequenced using the
            Novaseq 6000 platform (paired-end, 2x150). The assembly, obtained
            with Spades v3.15.3, contains 31 scaffolds with a N50 of 697,134
            bp (L50 of 5) and a cumulative length of 10,580,516 bp. This
            assembly includes the mitochondrial chromosome. The gene annotation
            consists of 5877 coding genes yielding to a BUSCO score of 99.3%.
